Subject: [PATCH 07/21] Add verified Aramco FY2024 D&A, FY2025 dividend
 installments and adjusted EBIT

Reported figures from the Aramco 2025 annual report only, no derived
values: 2024 depreciation and amortization (income statement comparative,
cross-checked with the cash-flow statement), the four quarterly dividend
installments of 2025 (note 37), and consolidated adjusted EBIT for 2025
and 2024 under the existing Adjusted EBIT mapping in
config/supplements/2222.json. Each fact cites its PDF page and table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
